Agreed. Though I do love polypiling, I've ascended plenty of times
without doing it, and don't consider it at all essential or
unbalancing. I'll wish for a magic marker if I don't find one (or wish
for another even if I do), but I'd never wish for a wand o poly unless
I really had wishes to burn and time to kill; guaranteed results are
better, even if the odds are very good at producing certain useful
scrolls. Enchant armor is very handy, but IMHO it's much nicer to have
the option to write *any* scroll, if you suddenly find you've
forgotten to bring gold detection to the Planes, for example.

